caught,Joe caught a grasshopper and it spit brown juice on him.
taught,The teacher taught the students how to memorize their multiplication tables.
fraught,Climbing the old railroad trellis was an adventure fraught with danger.
naughty,Good cats go in their litter box but naughty cats make you repaint your floor boards.
awful,Some people say that sardines smell awful.
lawful,Parking on the streets downtown is generally lawful.
trawler,Grandpa Bob might light to go fishing in a trawler.
bawler,The new baby was kind of a bawler.
saw,Noah looked out of the ark and saw a lot of water.
raw,The cabbage was raw and wonderful.
awesome,The Chik-Fil-A sauce was awesome.
claw,The raven had a really big claw.
lawyer,The lawyer was really good at proving his points.
straw,The kids loved to play in the bales of straw.
crawl,The bawly baby also liked to crawl.

